      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, it is quite strange to not have the fingers move at all when gestures are toggled off. At bare minimum the default hand animations for gestures should play when gestures are off.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
