  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Gesture toggle is an amazing feature, and with avatars 3.0 there is no reason to keep it index-exclusive anymore.\nIt would be nice for Oculus (or any other headset basically) users to be able to lock their facial expression and keep moving their fingers, even if to pre-animated hand positions, and if gesture toggle state was exposed as an animator parameter, it could be perfectly doable with a bit of careful transition condition modification.\nBesides, more animator parameters is more flexibility!",
